/PHASE4_ARCHITECTURE.md
/PRODUCT.md
/SCALING.md
/nook-cc-workflow-and-rituals.md
/CLAUDE.md

# analytical feature backlog (scratch, not part of the app)
/features.md

# windows git-bash crash dumps
*.stackdump

# brand logo scratch / source art (not part of the app build)
/brand-logos/
/Logo concept.jpg
